{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788232047955,"sessionID":"ses_fa52b88b3ffeUF09L5H3uZ1cg4","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"call_13d481f26f48434a8f9293dc","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-0bivsr25/retort-e0c09c17c08e/brazilian_soccer/models.py","newString":"@dataclass\nclass Match:\n    competition: str\n    season: int\n    date: date | None\n    home_key: str\n    away_key: str\n    home_goal: int | None\n    away_goal: int | None\n    source: str\n    home_raw: str = \"\"\n    away_raw: str = \"\"\n    time: str | None = None\n    round: int | None = None\n    stage: str | None = None\n    arena: str | None = None\n    home_state: str | None = None\n    away_state: str | None = None","oldString":"@dataclass\nclass Match:\n    competition: str\n    season: int\n    date: date | None\n    home_key: str\n    away_key: str\n    home_goal: int | None\n    away_goal: int | None\n    source: str\n    time: str | None = None\n    round: int | None = None\n    stage: str | None = None\n    arena: str | None = None\n    home_state: str | None = None\n    away_state: str | None = None"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-0bivsr25/retort-e0c09c17c08e/brazilian_soccer/models.py\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-0bivsr25/retort-e0c09c17c08e/brazilian_soccer/models.py\n+++ /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-0bivsr25/retort-e0c09c17c08e/brazilian_soccer/models.py\n@@ -48,8 +48,10 @@\n away_key: str\n home_goal: int | None\n away_goal: int | None\n source: str\n+home_raw: str = \"\"\n+away_raw: str = \"\"\n time: str | None = None\n round: int | None = None\n stage: str | None = None\n arena: str | None = None\n","filediff":{"file":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-0bivsr25/retort-e0c09c17c08e/brazilian_soccer/models.py","patch":"Index: /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-0bivsr25/retort-e0c09c17c08e/brazilian_soccer/models.py\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-0bivsr25/retort-e0c09c17c08e/brazilian_soccer/models.py\n+++ /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-0bivsr25/retort-e0c09c17c08e/brazilian_soccer/models.py\n@@ -48,8 +48,10 @@\n away_key: str\n home_goal: int | None\n away_goal: int | None\n source: str\n+home_raw: str = \"\"\n+away_raw: str = \"\"\n time: str | None = None\n round: int | None = None\n stage: str | None = None\n arena: str | None = None\n","additions":2,"deletions":0},"truncated":false},"title":"brazilian_soccer/models.py","time":{"start":1788232047952,"end":1788232047954}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Wait — there's a design flaw: `registry.register()` returns the PROVISIONAL key before finalize, and Match objects store provisional keys like \"atletico|PR\" (which happens to be final for ambiguous ones) but for unambiguous ones like \"palmeiras\" provisional is \"palmeiras\" too (no code)... Provisional key = base_key|code if code else base_key. Final key differs when: ambiguous base (e.g. \"internacional\" bare → provisional \"internacional\", final \"internacional|RS\") or unambiguous-with-code (e.g. \"cuiaba|MT\" → provisional \"cuiaba|MT\", final \"cuiaba\"). So Match.home_key provisional values WON'T match final keys. I must re-resolve after finalize.\n\nCleaner: don't store keys during load — store RAW names in intermediate, then map after finalize. But Match dataclass has home_key... Approach: in load_all, after finalize, for each match: m.home_key = registry.key_for(<original raw>). But Match doesn't keep the raw. Options:\n1. Keep a parallel raw on Match (home_raw/away_raw) — extra memory but fine (~24k matches).\n2. Since key_for(raw) is deterministic post-finalize, registry._raw_cache maps raw→final key. During load, register() can be called and MATCH stores provisional; then in load_all, recompute via a mapping provisional→final? Not possible directly (provisional loses info: \"internacional\" could be internacional|RS or |SC).\n\nSimplest correct: store raw names on Match during load; after finalize, set keys. Let me add `home_raw`, `away_raw` fields to Match, populated in loader; in load_all after finalize: m.home_key = registry.key_for(m.home_raw); m.away_key = ...; then keep raws for display? Display comes from registry.display(key). Player: club_raw already stored ✓ — after finalize: p.club_key = registry.key_for(p.club_raw); p.club_display = registry.display(p.club_key).\n\nAlso remove the unused `_league_stage` function and unused imports (defaultdict, LIBERTADORES). Fix the redundant `parse_int(r.get(c))` called twice in skills comprehension (minor perf, fine but let me clean).\n\nAlso note: `load_match_rows` uses registry.register(...) return value — remove that usage; store raw strings instead.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05aef9d45001z9OLhOo2qko1Cv","sessionID":"ses_fa52b88b3ffeUF09L5H3uZ1cg4","messageID":"msg_05aef2422001u1E3jOqH7zc5g0"}}
