he famous-ish is Ypiranga-RS (recent Série C). Add RS.)\n\nAlso add \"atletico|GO\" override etc. already present. Also, while at it: the \"Nacional\" bare (AM) — states {AM} only → unambiguous ✓ fine.\n\nAdd these 4 to DEFAULT_STATE.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05afa3a15001McJqjzxGZ2UGa9","sessionID":"ses_fa52b88b3ffeUF09L5H3uZ1cg4","messageID":"msg_05af9f035001LttVtXSDvwaPJd"}}
