{"type":"text","timestamp":1788235236934,"sessionID":"ses_fa52b88b3ffeUF09L5H3uZ1cg4","part":{"id":"prt_05b201b75001qbAjNU0zBPdzeJ","messageID":"msg_05b1fd8c6001tn7s7oCHHnFOuG","sessionID":"ses_fa52b88b3ffeUF09L5H3uZ1cg4","type":"text","text":"Implementation complete — **112 tests pass** (BDD + unit + sample-questions + MCP e2e), server builds and runs.\n\n## What was built\n\n**MCP server** (`server.py`, stdio) with 14 tools + 4 resources, backed by all 6 CSVs (~17k deduped matches, 18k players, loads in 0.6s):\n\n- **Match queries**: `search_matches` (team/opponent/competition/season/stage/date-range), `get_head_to_head` (with derby detection)\n- **Team queries**: `get_team_stats`, `get_team_history`, `list_teams`\n- **Competition queries**: `get_standings` (computed from results), `get_competitions`, `compare_seasons`\n- **Player queries**: `search_players`, `get_player`, `search_players_at_club`\n- **Statistics**: `get_statistics` (avg goals, home/away rates, biggest wins, best records), `get_derbies` (15 rivalries)\n- **NL fallback**: `answer_question` — deterministic router\n\n**Data-quality layer** (`brazilian_soccer/`): 625 team-name variants → canonical clubs (state-suffix ambiguity, country codes, accent-insensitive, curated aliases); 3-format date parsing; cross-source dedupe verified to exactly 380 matches/38 per team per Série A season; COVID-season (2020→Feb 2021) and truncated-cup (2021 final) handling; UTF-8 preserved.\n\n**Verified against real-world facts**: 2019 champion Flamengo 90pts, correct relegation zones (incl. Botafogo's first-ever relegation in 2020), 2018 Lib final Boca–River, 2020/2021 cup finals, Neymar 92 at PSG.\n\n**Tests**: 6 Gherkin feature files with pytest-bdd step defs, 25 spec sample questions (incl. graceful not-found for Gabigol, absent from the FIFA export), MCP end-to-end over real stdio transport, and performance budget tests (<2s / <5s).","time":{"start":1788235225973,"end":1788235236929}}}
